    {
      "Text": "This update for apptainer fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in apptainer:\n\n- Update  go.opentelemetry.io/otel to 1.44.0 to fix CVE-2026-41178:\n  It caused 'Parse' to process arbitrarily large/invalid baggage\n  headers and log errors, enabling DoS via oversized inputs (bsc#1276731).\n",
